            "title": "Diagnose Mixed Inputs",
            "id": 152103,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Die erste Operation wandelt <code>\"free\"</code> in eine Zahl um. Welcher Handler passt zu diesem Fehler?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"order.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"price_text = \" /><text value=\"&quot;free&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"order = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"total = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"price = float(price_text)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"quantity = order[\" /><text value=\"&quot;quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"share = total / quantity\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"true\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>except ValueError:</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>except KeyError:</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>except ZeroDivisionError:</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>except TypeError:</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>except ValueError:</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Complete Three Handlers",
            "id": 152104,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Vervollständige den dritten Handler, um die Textgebühr <code>\"2\"</code> zum numerischen Preis hinzuzufügen.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"record.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"record = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;price&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;12&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  price = float(record[\" /><text value=\"&quot;price&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  quantity = record[\" /><text value=\"&quot;quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  total = price + \" /><text value=\"&quot;2&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Price failed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" KeyError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Read failed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" TypeError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Use compatible values&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"222\" endIndex=\"231\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"KeyError\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ValueError\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Use compatible values\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>TypeError</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Preserve Handler Order",
            "id": 152105,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was trifft auf diesen Code zu?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Value&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" KeyError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Key&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Other&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")`\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Verschiedene Fehlertypen können unterschiedlich behandelt werden</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Das alleinstehende <code>except</code> wird nach jedem Fehler ausgeführt</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nur das erste <code>except</code> kann jemals ausgeführt werden</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>ValueError</code> und <code>KeyError</code> geben <em>Other</em> aus</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Verschiedene Fehlertypen können unterschiedlich behandelt werden.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Preserve Exception Details",
            "id": 152106,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fange die Ausnahme für den fehlenden Schlüssel in der Variable <code>error</code> ab.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"profile.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"record = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;name&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ira&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(record[\" /><text value=\"&quot;role&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" KeyError \" /><text value=\"as\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" error:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(error)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"78\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"message\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"details\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"'role'\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>except</code>, gefolgt von <code>KeyError</code> und schließlich <code>as</code>, <code>error</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Build a Context Message",
            "id": 152107,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Vervollständige den f-String mit den Details der abgefangenen Ausnahme.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"quantity.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"quantity_text = \" /><text value=\"&quot;many&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  quantity = int(quantity_text)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError \" /><text value=\"as\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" error:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  message = \" /><text value=\"f&quot;Quantity failed: \" /><text value=\"{error}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(message)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"119\" endIndex=\"126\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Quantity failed: invalid literal for int() with base 10: 'many'\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>{error}</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
